=== REASONING ===
Aggregation rules applied:
  - Numeric signals: MAX(value_num) FILTER (WHERE signal_name = '...')
  - Text/enum signals: last(value_text, ts) — TimescaleDB latest-state, NOT MAX
  - Boolean signals: last(value_bool, ts) — latest bool state
  - Single-signal panels: direct value_num/value_bool/value_text (no GROUP BY needed)
  - Multi-signal panels: GROUP BY ts with FILTER aggregates to pivot rows back to columns

Performance:
  - All queries include: ts BETWEEN $__timeFrom() AND $__timeTo()
  - All queries include: signal_name IN (...) for index selectivity

Special cases:
  - di_torque mapped to DiTorqueActualF (NOT DiTorqueF) per spec
  - di_axle_speed and di_axle_speed_f both map to DiAxleSpeedF (single signal)
  - speed_limit_mode was text in old schema, now value_bool — adjusted CASE WHEN
  - DoorState is JSON in value_text — Door Opens count uses LIKE '%Open%'
  - convert_temp() and convert_speed() preserved for unit conversion

